  "notes": [
    "Synthetic data, no deployment mapping. Context is an explicit trusted snapshot, not authorization.",
    "Cases contain literal input/context/expected data. expected.code applies on rejection; expected.effect is the successful effect kind.",
    "Update cases start from defaultSession; success changes only expected.output_modalities, all other fields exactly retained. Failure leaves the entire original unchanged. session.update wire envelopes require session.type:realtime; applySessionUpdate takes a partial patch.",
    "Text limits count Unicode scalars; JSON limits count UTF-8 bytes. No normalization, trimming or case folding of item text.",
    "GA assistant item content uses output_audio/output_text; response content parts use audio/text.",
    "event_id is correlation, not idempotency. metadata.operation_id is a documented application UUID key.",
    "response.input replaces default context with response-local context. Exact stored-item equality and same-ID reuse are local subset requirements, not proven OpenAI-server dedup/reference behavior. Do not append the item twice.",
    "Raw PCM bytes cannot prove source rate or channels; negotiated format is strict but real conversion/source validation is future integration.",
    "Server validators deliberately accept only the local emitted subset, not all GA optional fields. Null transcripts are not emitted. Unknown token usage is omitted.",
    "Queue/flow/segment/time/order enforcement, durable replay/conflicts, call authority and playback evidence are NOT implemented by shape validation."
